        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"d946842f-5182-45c5-ab73-f205c3d3d8df\",\"review_text\":\"I bay cot svedon all applications\"},{\"review_id\":\"232c669e-8bfe-4642-b0c9-229c2911cc6c\",\"review_text\":\"Sometimes the shuffle doesn't work. The app will play a total of 3 songs from my library, figured out how to fix this issue. Back to being a great app.\"},{\"review_id\":\"fbb8cab0-eb66-49de-9624-a06015514118\",\"review_text\":\"lol need prem to play music\"},{\"review_id\":\"9e3a706c-f502-4664-a23f-33f3480eca64\",\"review_text\":\"Useless aap boycott sweden\"},{\"review_id\":\"bc16ea78-88c6-41de-bf61-a9e94797bd0d\",\"review_text\":\"Starts playing automatically when connected to Bluetooth even if it was not open or is not the selected input on the device. A setting to disable auto play on Bluetooth connect would be helpful.\"},{\"review_id\":\"b66592e1-60d6-4bd5-8e08-ba98fa7a7d0a\",\"review_text\":\"Lots of ads\"},{\"review_id\":\"f9f37179-0072-4c05-b1bb-427d1728e86f\",\"review_text\":\"Why swidden burn holy Quran 👿\"},{\"review_id\":\"5a78a8de-6954-46cd-bbee-86bd3b359811\",\"review_text\":\"It's very useful and easy to use\"},{\"review_id\":\"a522fc9f-4a4c-48d8-998f-03c394671db8\",\"review_text\":\"Music lover\"},{\"review_id\":\"9bd18730-c1ef-401c-99dd-8f95ce5c1ad1\",\"review_text\":\"@SpotifyKR and @Spotify being mum about the whole situation shows that not only they support bullies but also they don't care that a woman was harrassed because of their actions. We know what kind of morals they have... #SpotifySupportsBullies SPOTIFY APOLOGIZE TO LISA\"}]}"
